WEBVTT

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:06.650
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY
MOBILE SUIT</b>

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:12.610
The furious rain, Makes my heart shake
hageshii ame ga, kokoro wo yuruwaseru

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:15.820
Like it did on that day
Ano hi no youni

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:22.910
But I just ran through, In my dream I had till yesterday
Tada hashirinuketa, kinou made no MY DREAM

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.710
...I still believe
...shinjiteiru no sa

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:34.470
I'm willing to fight, An endless defense
Owari no nai, defense demo ii yo

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:42.350
As long as you, Keep on gazing at me
Kimi ga boku wo, mitsumetsuzukete kureru nara

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:45.270
STAND UP TO THE VICTORY!

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:50.980
Turn to face all the mornings ahead, And someday
Ikutsumono asa wo mukae, Itsuka kitto

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:53.860
Try to seize them
tsukande miseru

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:56.450
STAND UP TO THE VICTORY!

00:00:56.780 --> 00:01:02.120
Even if nothing, Lies on the other side
Sono mukougawa ni, nanimonakutemo

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:06.040
It doesn't matter to me
kamawanai kara

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:14.050
...Just as long as I can embrace, Your gentle, irreplaceable smile!
Kakegae no nai, kimi no yasashii egao daite

00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:30.400
Üso managed to dodge Cronicle's attacks because he was wary,

00:01:30.430 --> 00:01:32.360
and due to his home field advantage.

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:34.800
However, from this point forward,

00:01:34.830 --> 00:01:38.530
the war the adults are waging won't be fought in Kasarelia from here on.

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:43.100
And so, as Üso is dragged further into this war of machines,

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:45.900
Shahkti fears for him from the bottom of her heart.

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:48.360
GODZORLA'S COUNTERATTACK

00:01:48.360 --> 00:01:50.200
"Godzorla's Counterattack".

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:50.730
GODZORLA'S COUNTERATTACK

00:01:56.230 --> 00:01:57.630
That hurts!

00:01:57.660 --> 00:01:59.560
Üso! Hey! Ow...

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:02.560
All right, Üso! You're a genius!

00:02:02.860 --> 00:02:04.630
Thanks, Odelo!

00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:06.360
Üso Ewin?

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:07.130
Yes?

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:08.900
Are you going to play around all day?

00:02:08.930 --> 00:02:11.500
Secure from V mode and get that thing stowed.

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:12.360
Yes, ma'am.

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:15.000
So, to secure from V mode...

00:02:15.930 --> 00:02:18.330
Okay, push the break command key.

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:21.530
Do it gently. We've never actually broken this unit apart before.

00:02:21.560 --> 00:02:26.560
And you still had me dock this thing in the middle of a battle?!

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:28.230
Sorry, Üso.

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:31.230
It's because we believe in your abilities.

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:33.230
I can't believe these people.

00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:41.160
Just set it down there, Leonid!

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:44.500
Odelo! Recover the Bottom Limb from there.

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:45.760
Bottom Limb?

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:47.960
The Boots. The part that's standing.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:48.830
They're standing.

00:02:48.860 --> 00:02:50.330
Yeah, they're really standing.

00:02:52.030 --> 00:02:52.760
Odelo!

00:02:52.800 --> 00:02:53.630
Gotcha!

00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:55.800
I'll handle the Camion.

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:57.260
Suzy, give us a hand.

00:02:57.930 --> 00:02:58.600
Ow!

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:03.060
Yes, I see it. Right, understood.

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:20.760
You say that pilot's really young, huh?

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:22.400
Let's go greet the new ace.

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:24.260
Huh? He was piloting it?!

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:25.330
Where'd he come from?

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:26.230
How'd he get aboard?

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:27.260
Am I in trouble?

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:29.360
You were the one who fought that battle?

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:31.660
I told you the pilot was young.

00:03:31.700 --> 00:03:33.360
What is he, in elementary school?!

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:37.930
Is there a problem?

00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:43.630
Everyone was watching you fight from here in the factory.

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:47.200
They had no idea a young boy was piloting it, though.

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:49.030
Um... Sorry.

00:03:49.430 --> 00:03:50.260
Weren't you scared?

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:51.400
Yeah, I was.

00:03:51.430 --> 00:03:53.160
We were giving you cover fire, too.

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:55.260
Maybe you should thank us for that.

00:03:55.730 --> 00:03:57.600
You're right. Thanks!

00:03:57.660 --> 00:04:00.860
Your modesty makes you easy to get along with.

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:03.460
Where's Shahkti?

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:05.230
I'm not sure.

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:06.800
Probably taking Karlmann for a walk.

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:10.700
Flanders.

00:04:13.530 --> 00:04:18.730
The young ones...

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:25.400
...spread their wings of dreams,

00:04:26.060 --> 00:04:32.330
as they scatter the red poppy blossoms...

00:04:32.360 --> 00:04:33.230
How does she know the song my sister used to sing?

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:36.500
...they set off on their voyage.

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:41.100
Why do that girl and that baby keep showing up wherever I go?

00:04:41.100 --> 00:04:41.160
...they set off on their voyage.

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:43.000
It's uncanny.

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:44.400
Ensign Garry Tunn!

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:47.460
Just give me painkillers! I can still fight just fine!

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:50.560
Which is it?

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:53.200
The one in front. I take no responsibility for this!

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:54.260
Fine.

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:01.200
We received word that Ltjg. Cronicle is alive.

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:02.860
Your hindsight is 20/20!

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:04.960
What?

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:08.030
Ensign Garry Tunn is acting like he wants to sortie on his own...

00:05:08.060 --> 00:05:10.100
...and is headed for the Godzorla hangar!

00:05:10.130 --> 00:05:11.100
Hang on.

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:15.060
Looks like this situation needs to be dealt with.

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:15.730
Yes.

00:05:15.760 --> 00:05:16.500
Right!

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:21.360
Ensign Garry Tunn, be reasonable!

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:24.160
We've only just assembled the Godzorla!

00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:25.530
As long as it moves!

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:26.600
Ensign!

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:29.330
Hey, when are you taking this into combat?

00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:30.730
Immediately!

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:34.860
Garry, stop! You're in no condition to do this!

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:40.660
You'll get solitary for this, understand?!

00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:44.760
Please let me avenge Sabat's death!

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:45.760
Stop him!

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:47.060
Let him go.

00:05:47.100 --> 00:05:48.030
Why?!

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:51.360
That's what happens when your lover is killed.

00:05:52.360 --> 00:05:53.730
Figuratively speaking.

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:56.430
Hatred is stronger than any weapon.

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:59.900
Even you must admit it'd make the battle easier...

00:05:59.930 --> 00:06:02.200
...if Garry encounters that white mobile suit, right, Wattary?

00:06:02.230 --> 00:06:03.600
Yes, of course!

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:05.930
Dupré, deploy the mobile armor Recarl!

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:08.260
Monitor's Garry's actions, but don't interfere.

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:08.760
Yes, ma'am!

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:19.930
If I don't avenge Sabat, then who will?!

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:21.530
Thanks for the food! Thanks for the food!

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:25.000
There you go. Eat all you like!

00:06:25.630 --> 00:06:27.560
Where are Shahkti and Üso?

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:29.700
Shahkti?

00:06:30.760 --> 00:06:31.860
She's not here, huh?

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:37.860
Oh, Miss Katejina!

00:06:37.900 --> 00:06:38.830
What's wrong?

00:06:38.860 --> 00:06:41.760
Nothing. So, how'd you like my piloting?

00:06:43.260 --> 00:06:44.930
You seem unharmed.

00:06:45.160 --> 00:06:45.860
Yeah.

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:49.900
So, how did it feel to kill somebody?

00:06:52.660 --> 00:06:54.100
What do you mean?

00:06:54.130 --> 00:06:55.260
What I mean?

00:06:56.260 --> 00:06:59.830
I mean, how can a kid like you do something like that?

00:06:59.860 --> 00:07:01.660
I just can't believe it.

00:07:03.030 --> 00:07:06.630
Neither can I. I was just afraid, that's all.

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:09.760
That makes you pretty normal.

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:13.200
I didn't do it because I wanted to.

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:21.160
Just don't turn into someone scary, Üso.

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:44.060
These people move faster than I expected.

00:07:48.130 --> 00:07:49.760
We've got the bunkers set up!

00:07:49.830 --> 00:07:52.700
Strike first, and don't let them find our location!

00:07:53.960 --> 00:07:56.760
Their preparations are quick too, but I won't let them succeed!

00:08:01.130 --> 00:08:03.330
The enemy's secret factory is here!

00:08:09.330 --> 00:08:12.760
So, Cronicle's alive despite his disgrace, huh?

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:17.060
They still can't use Minovsky particles.

00:08:17.630 --> 00:08:19.000
There they are!

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:21.400
You mean a spy got in?

00:08:22.800 --> 00:08:25.830
I know they've got lots of trucks hidden there.

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:29.160
If Cronicle's alive, he's already making his escape.

00:08:29.300 --> 00:08:30.630
If our location's blown, open fire!

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:33.230
No, not till the attack begins! Here he comes!

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:35.000
Go!

00:08:39.930 --> 00:08:41.060
There's just one unit!

00:08:41.130 --> 00:08:42.160
Open fire!

00:08:46.030 --> 00:08:48.360
They only sent one of the new models?

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:50.000
Where are the reinforcements?!

00:08:50.100 --> 00:08:50.760
Haro!

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:52.460
Everyone all right?

00:08:55.060 --> 00:08:55.900
You okay?

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:58.700
For now. I wish we had run away sooner!

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:02.060
Üso, I know you must still be tired, but sortie again.

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:04.560
Miss Marbet, did you reopen your wound?

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:07.160
It's because I keep walking on it.

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:11.030
You must be frightened, Üso.

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:13.060
You don't have to go.

00:09:13.230 --> 00:09:16.130
B-But, then who will?

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:19.100
Someone among the resistance here will do it, surely!

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:23.630
You'd rather fight for these people than go look for Shahkti?!

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:26.860
This boy has nothing to do with this war!

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:29.900
Leave it to the adults to kill each other!

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:32.730
We're fighting to protect something!

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:36.100
Yes, and maybe a pompous, indifferent rich girl like you...

00:09:36.130 --> 00:09:37.960
...should stay out of this!

00:09:38.030 --> 00:09:39.800
Üso is just a child!

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:43.630
We see Üso as much more than that, Miss Katejina!

00:09:44.400 --> 00:09:45.360
That was close!

00:09:47.130 --> 00:09:48.960
I... I...

00:09:49.460 --> 00:09:54.660
I don't want Miss Katejina or Miss Marbet or anyone else here to die!

00:09:58.530 --> 00:10:02.600
That's just how he is, that boy... his heart...

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:05.000
It's a treasure, Miss Katejina.

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:08.130
A heart I want to cherish more than anything.

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:11.560
Are you saying I was wrong?

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:13.500
Not wrong.

00:10:13.860 --> 00:10:16.300
I was just saying that you're pompous.

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:19.230
Üso, do you still remember the docking procedure?

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:21.100
What? Y-Yes!

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:24.560
To hell with this thing!

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:29.930
Core fighter, ready to launch!

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:34.130
What about the timing for sending out the core fighter?

00:10:39.760 --> 00:10:40.760
Here I go!

00:11:10.760 --> 00:11:11.700
Here?

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:19.330
That couldn't have killed Sabat!

00:11:26.630 --> 00:11:29.000
The vulcans and the ground emplacements aren't working!

00:11:29.030 --> 00:11:29.960
Now what?!

00:11:34.660 --> 00:11:38.500
Why, you... Hiding in the woods like pigs!

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:43.960
Send out the Hanger!

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:48.230
Üso! We're going to send up a red smoke marker, then launch the Top Limb!

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:50.730
Alright! Sorry, but you'll have to chase it down!

00:11:50.760 --> 00:11:51.600
Launch!

00:11:51.630 --> 00:11:53.460
Launching! Go!

00:11:59.560 --> 00:12:01.330
He's taking all my concentration.

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:02.830
V mode, command...

00:12:08.860 --> 00:12:10.600
What?! A large fighter?!

00:12:10.630 --> 00:12:12.330
What happened to the little one?!

00:12:17.700 --> 00:12:19.300
Where's the little one?

00:12:24.730 --> 00:12:28.300
This is the north entrance elevator. The timing to send out the Boots...

00:12:28.800 --> 00:12:29.900
He got away!

00:12:30.660 --> 00:12:33.830
Hold on! We'll use the Boots as a diversion!

00:12:34.200 --> 00:12:37.000
Üso will figure it out if we launch a yellow flare!

00:12:37.030 --> 00:12:40.600
Okay, we'll send up a flare! Got that, Kuffu?

00:12:40.630 --> 00:12:43.460
Ready when you are! Flare, yellow!

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:45.530
Roger! When do I fire it?

00:12:45.560 --> 00:12:46.660
In a sec!

00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:56.260
Reinforcements?! Dammit!

00:12:56.300 --> 00:12:58.760
If that little one's still around, they'll surround me!

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:15.460
I see! This is the new machine that the League Militaire has developed.

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:17.500
Ah, that thing?

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:18.230
Yes!

00:13:18.760 --> 00:13:20.200
It's about to dock.

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:23.630
Are they intensifying the Minovsky particle dispersal?

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:25.360
I'll switch to the onboard camera.

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:32.130
It'll take a while to analyze the equipment in this video.

00:13:33.130 --> 00:13:34.000
Wattary...

00:13:34.030 --> 00:13:36.430
He's moving well, despite his pain, isn't he?

00:13:37.200 --> 00:13:40.460
Don't you think it shows a soldier compassion when...

00:13:40.930 --> 00:13:42.460
...you tell him where he'll die?

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:43.830
That's true.

00:13:43.860 --> 00:13:47.900
And now we have test flight data for both the Recarl and the Godzorla.

00:13:48.360 --> 00:13:50.100
Metchet, return to base.

00:13:55.830 --> 00:13:58.960
I happen to like battling with sabers in a mobile suit!

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:01.300
I'll slash the pilot in half and...

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:04.960
...paint that white and blue mobile suit red with his blood!

00:14:18.200 --> 00:14:20.400
Üso! You're fighting again?

00:14:20.600 --> 00:14:23.400
You'll be killed! Please, don't die!

00:14:28.700 --> 00:14:30.360
If I can just stop him...!

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:34.360
What?!

00:14:36.630 --> 00:14:40.930
What can a mobile suit developed by civilians do?!

00:14:51.900 --> 00:14:52.730
What?!

00:14:53.300 --> 00:14:54.960
Why, you!

00:15:08.430 --> 00:15:11.600
Is it over? It is, right?

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:12.930
What?

00:15:23.530 --> 00:15:25.560
The pilot. What's he doing?

00:15:28.060 --> 00:15:31.330
I'm not... I'm not beaten, yet!

00:15:36.960 --> 00:15:42.960
Not by one mobile suit! I won't die like Sabat!

00:15:44.030 --> 00:15:47.500
Stay back. Don't come closer! If you do...

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:56.600
I still have a round or two in the head vulcans!

00:15:56.700 --> 00:15:59.960
If I use them, then you'll... You'll...

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:03.160
I am Garry Tunn!

00:16:05.160 --> 00:16:06.530
I really will shoot!

00:16:07.930 --> 00:16:11.100
Go to Hell!

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:25.160
I'll kill every last one of you!

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:31.000
Rage can drive a man to that.

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:34.900
Üso, don't let it get to you.

00:16:35.530 --> 00:16:39.600
But... But, everything is my fault.

00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:40.960
Don't be absurd.

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:45.130
You think you're so important that you affect...

00:16:45.160 --> 00:16:47.400
...the lives of every enemy pilot?

00:16:47.760 --> 00:16:48.800
Surely not.

00:16:49.200 --> 00:16:51.730
You shouldn't let it get to you so easily.

00:16:52.100 --> 00:16:55.760
But I'm glad Üso feels that way.

00:16:56.330 --> 00:17:00.430
I hate how you people throw a child like him into a war!

00:17:00.460 --> 00:17:03.960
I can't really refute your way of thinking, but...

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:05.730
But! But! But!

00:17:05.860 --> 00:17:08.330
That kind of thinking doesn't change the world!

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:11.730
You think there are all sorts of ways that justify it, right?!

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:17.800
Shahkti!

00:17:19.060 --> 00:17:20.730
Where did you go?

00:17:20.860 --> 00:17:24.600
I'm sorry, but... Thank goodness!

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:30.400
Don't cry, you two.

00:17:31.630 --> 00:17:33.300
Let's go back to Kasarelia.

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:35.800
Do that, Üso.

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:39.730
I agree with what Shahkti says.

00:17:41.430 --> 00:17:44.400
Yeah. I'll think about it.

00:17:45.100 --> 00:17:48.930
Now that BESPA knows about this place, we can't postpone it any longer.

00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:52.060
All equipment and units in this factory will be dismantled.

00:17:52.560 --> 00:17:55.430
We'll load it aboard the Camion unit tomorrow morning.

00:17:55.460 --> 00:17:57.300
Until then, we'll have an orderly evacuation.

00:17:57.330 --> 00:17:59.830
Just as we stop worrying about food, this happens.

00:17:59.860 --> 00:18:01.530
Now where are we going?

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:03.560
Do we stick with the old guys?

00:18:04.400 --> 00:18:06.830
Man, what do we do?

00:18:07.860 --> 00:18:09.630
Üso, I think we...

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:12.060
Üso, are you asleep?

00:18:14.660 --> 00:18:18.260
He's tired. Let him rest till morning.

00:18:18.300 --> 00:18:18.730
Yes, ma'am.

00:18:18.760 --> 00:18:20.730
How do we contact the Shrike team?

00:18:21.560 --> 00:18:24.930
Even using radio, I still need to keep my distance.

00:18:45.300 --> 00:18:47.260
What's going on in England?

00:18:47.300 --> 00:18:49.560
Count, we need to hurry.

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:52.460
The one they call Count is the leader, huh?

00:18:55.160 --> 00:18:56.300
Here we go.

00:18:58.630 --> 00:19:00.230
That's not a toilet!

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:03.030
Where do we send our med staff?

00:19:03.060 --> 00:19:05.530
We can resupply around point DD.

00:19:10.360 --> 00:19:11.830
You went to pee?

00:19:26.960 --> 00:19:29.400
Those eyes... They were looking at me.

00:19:48.060 --> 00:19:50.460
Hurry up and regroup!

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:52.300
Vive la League Militaire!

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:53.230
Oh, my...

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:55.160
Let's relax and have some breakfast.

00:19:55.200 --> 00:19:58.230
We haven't even finished the first formation yet.

00:20:04.530 --> 00:20:08.600
Our primary objective is the destruction of the League Militaire factory!

00:20:08.630 --> 00:20:09.500
Drop!

00:20:20.100 --> 00:20:23.000
All hands, battle stations! Romero! Otis!

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:27.760
Leonid, can we send Üso out to counter them?

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:36.500
Üso, don't!

00:20:36.560 --> 00:20:37.500
Sis!

00:20:37.660 --> 00:20:38.800
You're scared, right?

00:20:39.160 --> 00:20:41.130
I am! That's why!

00:20:41.200 --> 00:20:44.060
Would you rather just die?! Just let them kill us?!

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:45.630
I don't want to!

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:50.630
Just dying without ever knowing what happened to my dad and mom!

00:20:52.860 --> 00:20:54.960
Shahkti, you don't want to die...

00:20:55.000 --> 00:20:58.060
...without finding out who your parents are, do you?

00:20:58.100 --> 00:20:59.100
No.

00:20:59.730 --> 00:21:00.830
That's why I'm going.

00:21:03.960 --> 00:21:04.830
Get down!

00:21:08.930 --> 00:21:09.700
You...

00:21:10.460 --> 00:21:13.930
Just get out of here, now!

00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:14.630
Right.

00:21:14.900 --> 00:21:15.760
Suzy!

00:21:17.660 --> 00:21:19.800
Odelo! Warren!

00:21:19.830 --> 00:21:20.660
Karl!

00:21:30.300 --> 00:21:31.900
All units, jettison magazines.

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:34.700
Attack everyone fleeing the facility!

00:21:47.230 --> 00:21:51.060
So, we couldn't capture that League Militaire mobile suit, huh?

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:51.730
What?!

00:21:58.500 --> 00:22:01.900
There it is! The white mobile suit's cockpit!

00:22:24.060 --> 00:22:29.530
Piercing the sky, Blue lightning
sora wo tsukisasu aoi inazuma

00:22:29.530 --> 00:22:35.320
Staining the earth, With the shadow of greed
daichi o someteku, yokubou no kage

00:22:36.370 --> 00:22:41.460
Once again, when the nightmare, Envelops the Earth
futatabi akumu ga, sekai wo tsutsumu toki

00:22:41.460 --> 00:22:46.790
You hear voices crying out "S.O.S."
"SOS" wo sakebu koe ga kikoeru...

00:22:48.630 --> 00:22:54.130
Let proud hope fill your heart
hokoritakaki kibou wo mune ni

00:22:54.720 --> 00:23:03.100
And stand up! Say a prayer for peace!!
tachiagare! heiwa no inori komete!

00:23:04.100 --> 00:23:05.100
WINNERS FOREVER!

00:23:06.100 --> 00:23:08.980
In every age
itsuno jidai mo

00:23:08.980 --> 00:23:14.570
...People take risks for freedom
hito wa jiyuu wo kakete

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:17.000
WINNERS FOREVER!

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:21.240
The battle goes on
tatakai tsuzukeru

00:23:21.240 --> 00:23:25.920
Fighting all alone in solitude
kodoku na made ni hitori...

00:23:33.430 --> 00:23:37.830
Amidst the chaos of the air raid, the enemy hidden in the factory...

00:23:37.860 --> 00:23:40.960
...takes the count and Miss Katejina prisoner.

00:23:42.530 --> 00:23:46.060
Even though returning to Kasarelia is all I can think about,

00:23:46.600 --> 00:23:50.260
I understand why Üso's fear drives him to fight.

00:23:52.060 --> 00:23:53.960
Next time, on Mobile Suit Victory Gundam:

00:23:55.060 --> 00:23:55.460
Next Episode A WARRIOR'S BRILLIANCE

00:23:55.460 --> 00:23:57.430
"A Warrior's Brilliance".

00:23:57.430 --> 00:23:57.460
Next Episode A WARRIOR'S BRILLIANCE

00:23:57.460 --> 00:23:59.030
Please watch it!

00:23:59.030 --> 00:23:59.930
Next Episode A WARRIOR'S BRILLIANCE
